; ..\BSW\EcuM\EcuM.c	   392  /*! \brief      Calculates an array position.
; ..\BSW\EcuM\EcuM.c	   393   *  \details    Transforms the bit position of the passed wakeup source to a numerical value which can be used as an
; ..\BSW\EcuM\EcuM.c	   394   *              index to access an array.
; ..\BSW\EcuM\EcuM.c	   395   *  \param[in]  Wakeup source parameter.
